window.products.push({"id":222083,"name":"Classical Creations Chance Vought F4U Corsair Aircraft 12\" Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m5tBwCmaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a wall clock featuring the Chance Vought F4U-1A Corsair, one of the iconic aircraft of WWII. The top half of the clock face depicts a color illustration of the aircraft, and the bottom half lists statistics such as engine specifications, performance, armament, etc. It is approximately 12\" in diameter. This would make a great gift or personal item for the military aviation buff. About Our 12\" Wall Clocks Attractive and functional, our 12\" wall clocks feature beautiful photo-quality artwork and premium, USA-made clock motors. Their classic look and quiet operation make them perfect for just about any room in your home or office. We are sure you will be proud to give our clocks as gifts or treasure them yourself for years to come. Our Classic Artwork Most traditional artwork is rectangular, which leads to the question: \"How do you fit a square piece of artwork on a round clock?\" Most \"fine art\" clocks are made by either cropping a circle in the center of the artwork discarding much of the original image, or shrinking the image down and adding plain borders to fill the extra space. We chose to do something different. Our graphic artists start with a high-resolution copy of the original image, and use state-of-the-art software to digitally \"mold\" the rectangular artwork on the face of a circular clock. Each image is meticulously edited, and care is taken to preserve the integrity of the original artwork while minimizing the distortion inherent in this type of image manipulation. We think you will agree that our clocks are more attractive and capture the look of the original artwork better than other similar offerings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m5tBwCmaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classical Creations","source_asin":"B00AVGGK4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AVGGK4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AVGGK4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":222084,"name":"Table Pads for Dining Room Table, Custom Made, Premium Table Pad | Bundle with L&L Table Runner (2 Items)(Color: Chestnut Vinyl Top/Brown Dura-Velvet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lCrV7dqLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUNDLE (2 ITEMS) Table Pad with L&L TABLE RUNNER (Ivory) Table Pads For Dining Room Table - Top Pad Color: Chestnut with a Brown Dura-velvet Bottom - Max. Size: 80\" Long 54\" Wide, Extension Pads NOT Included. *Solid Fiberboard Core (Not Layered) *Lighter Weight for Ease of Handling *Will Not Bend or Bow (Like Layered Construction) *Exclusive Precision Cutting *Patented Magnetic Locking System *Limited Lifetime Warranty - Made in the USA - Dining tables are prone to scratches, dents, heat and water damage. Accidents can and will happen, so ensure that your dining set is protected. Custom-made table pads! The most effective way to keep a dining room table looking like new and getting the maximum usage out of it is with a table pad protector. TABLE PAD FEATURES: * Heavy duty, washable, waterproof vinyl * Foldable *Protects your TABLE with 550 degrees of heat protection (NEVER PUT HOT ITEMS DIRECTLY ON THE VINYL TABLE PAD, THE VINYL WILL MELT). *Solid construction that will not warp, or be affected by humidity *The Patented Magnetic Locks, lock your table pads together for stability *Many colors to choose from *A full 1/2 inch thick of protection: ~ Decorative Vinyl ~ Insulating Felt ~ Solid Fiberboard Core ~ Soft Dura-Velvet Base ~ Will not Bend or Bow *100% Made in the USA. *Limited Lifetime Manufacturer Warranty *This table pad is limited 80\" long and 54\" wide. Table pad leaf extensions NOT INCLUDED. **If you know the manufacturer and pattern number of your Dining Table we may already have your template pattern in our data base and no measuring will be needed. This information can sometimes be found on the underside of your table top. ***ONCE YOU HAVE CHECKED OUT, ONE OF OUR FRIENDLY STAFF WILL CONTACT YOU VIA AMAZON MESSAGING. THE EMAIL WILL ASK YOU FOR THE DIMENSIONS AND COLOR OPTIONS BEFORE WE PUT YOUR ORDER IN PRODUCTION. ORDER NOW, You will love your new table pad!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lCrV7dqLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Custom Made TABLE PADS AND MORE!!!","source_asin":"B07GGC1D8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GGC1D8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GGC1D8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
