window.products.push({"id":222294,"name":"Eforcurtain White Fabric Stall Shower Curtain Liner 48 x72 inch, Waterproof Shower Curtain Machine Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-aHtQs0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"White shower curtains: Natural than plastic one, Washable and Reusable liner, It can be used as shower curtain liner or shower curtain for your bathroom Heavy fabric shower curtain liner: 130GSM thick and premium polyester fabric for your bathroom, easy to hang naturally and drapes nicely, long term use as shower liner or curtain Waterproof shower curtain liner: Made of premium fabric with the ultimate waterproof coating tech, making it completely water proof but still soft feeling. Washable shower curtain: Machine washable for keeping it fresh and reusable, 48 x 72 inches stall size fits for your stall with 8 rustproof grommets Stall shower curtain liner: Elegant drape with generous size 48-inch width by 72-inch length /122cm by 180cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H-aHtQs0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eforcurtain","source_asin":"B07536RBN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07536RBN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07536RBN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":222295,"name":"Hagen Renaker Ceramics Ferret Set of 2: Standing and Lying Ferrets 03318 and 03319","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+CRKIEDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hand-crafted in the USA since the 1940s. High-quality collectible figurines that do not lose value (unless you break them). John and Maxine Renaker started Hagen-Renaker in their garage in Culver City in the latter part of 1945. John Renaker set up the first kiln by running a garden hose from the family's gas stove. Maxine Renaker was the first designer and salesperson. After successfully selling their first pieces, they found they could not produce them. John Renaker's Mom, Moss Renaker, worked for a pottery in Monrovia called Walker Potteries. Her boss, Joe Walker, agreed to teach John about the pottery business. Maxine's Dad, Ole Hagen, built the couple their first factory. Ole who was a carpenter by trade, went to Oregon to get a load of lumber at wholesale cost, and he and his brother, Arne worked every weekend for months to build a combination factory and apartment. In gratitude, John and Maxine named their new company Hagen-Renaker. On Easter Sunday, 1946, the family and their fledgling company moved to Monrovia. The company first produced elaborately decorated plates and butter pats and shadow boxes. They were selling well, but there were difficulties with them related to firing and shipping. John Renaker noticed a small duck that Maxine had on her work bench. She was a Camp Fire Girl leader and had designed it for the kids. He saw potential in it and put it on the bottom of the company's order sheet. When he saw how it sold, he decided to change direction and produce small figurines. Soon they transformed Helen Perrin from a decorator into a designer, and she was joined by others. John and Maxine recognized artistic excellence and based their business on these talented designers. This tradition continues today. Maureen Love Calvert and Helen Perrin Farnlund are still providing a majority of the new items to the line and have been joined by Bob McGuinness and Kathleen Ellis. (Text is from the official Hagen-Renaker website.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+CRKIEDIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hagen Renaker Ceramics","source_asin":"B00R6XLI1O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00R6XLI1O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00R6XLI1O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
