window.products.push({"id":222297,"name":"Zulay Instant Read Food Thermometer - Waterproof Digital Meat Thermometer with Backlight, Calibration & Internal Magnetic Mount - Cooking Thermometer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81my6Byk0CL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"ACCURATELY FAST: Our meat thermometer, designed with a high-precision sensor, provides accurate readings within 3-4 seconds. This digital thermometer provides a wide temperature range from -58°F to 572°F (-50°C to 300°C) with an accuracy of ±1°C. You will no longer have to wait by the grill or stove to figure out the temperature of your food. SIMPLE TO USE AND STORE: The 10.5 inch foldable probe extends to start reading the temperature, while keeping your hand away from the heat; fold it back to turn it off. This food thermometer is designed with a power saver feature that turns off when the device is not in use for 10 minutes. The instant read thermometer has an internal magnet and a hole that allow convenient storage. EASY TO READ DISPLAY: This wireless meat thermometer comes with a large LCD, designed with a backlight, so you can always read the temperature of your food even when grilling outdoors in the dark; use the temperature chart for easy reading. You can now cook without guessing the food temperature during indoor or outdoor cooking, grilling, deep frying, baking, and more. DURABLE AND WATERPROOF: Designed with a food-grade ABS body, 304 stainless steel probe, and IP67-rated waterproof exterior, this cooking thermometer won’t break when placed under running water or during accidental drops. It can be cleaned by simply hand washing it under water (not dishwasher safe). HASSLE-FREE, ZULAY GUARANTEE: We love and take pride in our instant read meat thermometer and back this up with a lifetime guarantee. If there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right (even after the Amazon return window). Chances are that this will soon become your favorite kitchen gadget.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81my6Byk0CL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B08WJHQ818","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WJHQ818","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WJHQ818","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
