window.products.push({"id":222367,"name":"Super Soft Alpaca Wool Reversible Throw Blanket Radiant Royal Blue Color Black Cross Weave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AlIOp0gCL._AC_.jpg","description":"These baby soft alpaca fiber reversible throw blankets are incredibly luxurious to touch.  They are top quality and light weight yet very warm blankets that also can be used as throws. This one is a beautiful shade of woven royal blue and black that is now the ultimate in softness and cuddliness and will make an elegant finishing touch to any well-appointed bed. It is a large approximate 60 inches wide by 86 inches long, which will cover a double or queen size bed, and now weighs approximately 29 fuller ounces. Colors may vary slightly from the pictures shown. It was expertly hand woven in Ecuador and our label is attached. In case you did not know, alpaca is a specialty luxury fiber. More alpaca fiber is produced each year than cashmere or mohair. No other animal produces fiber that has the softness of cashmere, the luster of silk, the lightness of goose feathers, the durability of wool, and the warmth of a cozy fireplace. The alpaca has been domesticated (as versus its kin llama, which is primarily a work animal) and carefully bred for over 5,000 years as a luxury fiber-producing animal. Alpaca wool has been prized for centuries for its incredible combination of softness, lightness, and warmth. Alpaca is best cared for by dry cleaning although light soiling can frequently be removed with water, especially if the stain has not set.  This is quality merchandise at a great price. And you no longer have to wait 10 to 21 days for this gorgeous alpaca blanket to be delivered from South America. We now store our inventory at Amazon warehouses in the USA and this product is eligible for FREE Super Saver and Prime Two-Day Shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AlIOp0gCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Gift Ideas Etc","source_asin":"B000LQI6P4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LQI6P4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LQI6P4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
