window.products.push({"id":222436,"name":"Cervical Memory Foam Pillow for Sleeping, Contour Pillow for Side Sleeper, Ergonomic Orthopedic Bed Pillow, Neck Pillow for Neck Pain, Odorless Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgcG0SjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ERGONOMIC DESIGN: This neck pillow is well designed to provide support according to your body's natural curves, reducing snoring and a more restful sleep. This memory foam pillow combines a neck roll pillow and a contour pillow, you can sleep on both sides. The cutout on the side gives your upper arm a place to rest and keep it angled so your shoulders don't bend over in front of you. NECK & BACK PAIN RELIEF: The proven contoured design perfectly supports and aligns your head, neck, shoulders and back. Reduces pressure on the cervical vertebra and spine. Improve sleep and relieve neck and shoulder pain. There are specific grooves that allows your arms to go under for comfortable sleep. You can lay on your stomach and warp your arms around the wings for perfect support. 100% PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM PILLOW: Our ergonomic sleeping pillow is CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX certificated high density slow rebound memory foam pillow. This will provide firm support for sleep with amazing comfort and softness. It retains its shape and sturdiness over time. Premium firm and not too soft to provides the maximum comfort and greatly ease your head, neck, shoulder and back muscle while you sleep on your back or side. REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE: The pillowcase is made of 100% polyester. The sleep-relieving neck pillow has a fine texture and a breathable surface that allows air to circulate, keeping the pillow cool as your sleep. It's removable, zippered and machine washable so you can always keep it clean. All materials are chemical-free. TWO HEIGHTS: The size of pillow: 23*14*2.8-3.8 inch. The higher side of the pillow has two corners because this side provides better support for your head and neck, keeping your neck in proper alignment with the rest of your body. 2 different heights of orthopedic butterfly shapes allow you to find the most comfortable position for a restful night's sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cgcG0SjqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAHASOLE","source_asin":"B09PY35Y8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PY35Y8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PY35Y8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
