window.products.push({"id":222481,"name":"Smart Humidifiers For Large Rooms (2.1Gal/8L), Room Humidifier For Bedroom Works With Alexa/Google, Plant Humidifier Indoor & Baby Humidifier, Top Fil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r7k82HBKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SMART APP & VOICE CONTROL】Try this Air humidifiers for large room powered by Carro (TUYA) App, you can control the air humidifier on your phone from anywhere. Adjust the custom mode, timers, schedules, mist levels, and display off. large Room humidifier for bedroom also works with Alexa, Google Assistant, or Siri for voice control. With a simple voice command, free your hands. 【HUMIDIFIERS FOR LARGE ROOM】 Tired of refilling frequently? With a large 8L tank, and up to 30 hours of operation, our cool mist humidifier will keep you comfortable constantly. Features a high mist output of up to 13oz (390ml) per hour, the large humidifier provides fast relief in rooms as large as 500ft². Just turn it on, enjoy the rich mist, and soothe your skin. 【CUSTOMIZED MIST】This bedroom humidifier or Plant humidifier indoor can adjust 3 mist levels, 0-8Hrs timers, and humidifier initial value of 60% RH. Just one touch has your air stay the way you like. Our baby humidifier or humidifier for plants will auto-adjust mist spray, to balance your target humidity set with App (40%~90%RH optional). Never worry about over-humidification. 【GREAT FOR BEDROOMS】 The easy clean humidifiers for bedroom run below 35dB. Also, you will love the display light that can be turned off with Carro Home App. Create soothing mist silently for babies to sleep soundly. This ultrasonic humidifier will shut off automatically if water is insufficient or reaches your desired humidity, so you no need to babysit it when going to sleep. (Tips: Please do not drop essential oils.) 【FOR BEST RESULTS】1.Please take out the paper in the fog guide tube and the foam in the water tank before using this air humidifier.2.Please do not take out the foam block in the fog float(indicated by arrows) 3. Please open 2.4Gwifi and Bluetooth first when connecting via App. Then turn on the humidifier and long press the power button until the humidifier wifi icon flashes to search.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r7k82HBKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carro","source_asin":"B0BRMH4D17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRMH4D17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRMH4D17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
