window.products.push({"id":222496,"name":"6 x 12 oz Easter Bread parchment baking paper Molds 'Traditional'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ne5RWQQOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Set of 6 pcs. with original designs (see photos). Made of food-safe, rigid baking paper our molds are oven safe up to 430 degrees Fahrenheit (220 degrees Celsius), freezer safe, and microwave safe. Fine food-grade freestanding disposable paper baking pans are good for Easter bread, panettone, cakes, brioche, kulich, cupcakes, jumbo muffins, bread baking and variety of projects in between. With these liners, you don't need metal baking pans. They are perfect for presenting your cakes to friends, selling them to your customers, or holding your bakery products ready on the table for your guests to enjoy. Note the molds are not recommended for liquid use, as the manufacturing process leaves many pinprick holes on the bottom of the cup that liquid may seep through. Use them for a thicker substance like dough or batter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ne5RWQQOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodya","source_asin":"B0868LQBH5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0868LQBH5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0868LQBH5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":222497,"name":"Modway Lippa 48\" Oval-Shaped Mid-Century Modern Dining Table with Artificial Marble Top and White Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":745.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dyC1ABO5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reflecting a seamless organic shape and timeless form, the Lippa dining table has become a symbol of modernism for over the past 60 years. Before its release, homes were filled with clunky remnants of an industrial age long gone by. But in order to advance into the new world, homes first had to transition from the traditional square table, into a piece that connoted progress. The base and dimensions are true to the original specifications, while the table’s oval-shaped artificial marble top, and tapered metal base, are carefully lacquered with a durable finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dyC1ABO5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modway","source_asin":"B07V8ZVBTJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V8ZVBTJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V8ZVBTJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
