window.products.push({"id":222605,"name":"MatriKX (32-250-10) 9.75\"x2.75\" CTO Carbon Block Chlorine Reduction 5 Micron Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319UnQGDchL._AC_.jpg","description":"FEATURES & BENEFITS 5 micron Nominal Filtration High Adsorptive Capacity and Efficiency Efficient Sediment Filter No Release of Carbon Fines Competitively Priced vs. GAC Filters Performance Tested and Verified by Independent Laboratory TestingTYPICAL USAGESMATRIKX + CTO/2 filters are the most widely used carbon block devices in the world and provide previously unattainable performance at the lowest price point. MATRIKX + CTO/2 filters simultaneously remove chlorine taste and odor and organic chemicals that contribute to taste and odor while providing the particulate filtration and dirt-holding capacity of an efficient 5 micron nominal sediment filter. These filters are optimized for applications where they perform the role of both a sediment and activated carbon filter.The extrusion process allows the production of a carbon block with more carbon, but a lower pressure drop. This enables a MATRIKX + CTO/2 filter to deliver extended life while removing sediment, chlorine taste and odor and organic contaminants from water, aqueous solutions or suspensions. The MATRIKX + CTO/2 is also widely used in filtering organic solvents. The MATRIKX + CTO/2 is ideal for use in residential and commercial water purification systems, food service, pre- and post-RO systems.MATRIKX + CTO/2 or GAC?The MATRIKX + CTO/2 is manufactured from high purity acid-washed activated carbon. Its dirt-holding capacity and the absence of carbon fines makes the MATRIKX + CTO/2 the filter of choice. A superior carbon block, MATRIKX + CTO/2 combines both high performance and integrity with an exceptional cost-to-performance value. As a result, MATRIKX + CTO/2 virtually renders GAC filters obsolete by comparison.Specifications Model: 3","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319UnQGDchL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KX Technologies","source_asin":"B00EZIBP4I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EZIBP4I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EZIBP4I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
