window.products.push({"id":222645,"name":"24 Inch Christmas Wreath for Front Door, Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Wreath with 60 LED Lights Battery Operated Christmas Decorations Red Berries Pin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918j-zANxoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Natural Realistic: Our Christmas wreath comes with 200 pine branches showing its lush form, super realistic and mesmerizing like nature. The Christmas door wreath made of artificial pines in a wreath base, dotted with rich red berries, three cedar and pine cones and frosted branches, The timeless appearance makes your home elegant and warm. Each prelit wreath is handcrafted, and great attention to detail and workmanship to premium quality. Original Design and Hand Made: Indoor or Outdoor Home Decor: Hang our Christmas wreath above your fireplace, on your front door, on a living room wall, on windows,or as table decoration to celebrate the season and festivals, especially on Christmas. 8 Light Modes: The xmas wreaths for front door has 60 LED lights, 8 light modes, and comes with a remote control. You can adjust the light modes to your liking - in wave, sequential, slow glow, chasing/flash, slow fade, flash, steady on, combination (requires 3 AA batteries, not included). Easy to Maintain: Christmas decorations for home require no special cleaning, and it is easy to store and reusable. If you hang it outdoors, it is recommended to hang it under a shelter to avoid direct sunlight and rain. Perfect Front Door Christmas Decoration: Battery operated Christmas wreath are great for decorating spaces. Such as front door, bedroom, Christmas party, wedding, wall, fireplace, kitchen, stairs, shop, garden, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918j-zANxoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZHIYIN","source_asin":"B0BBVFS45H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBVFS45H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBVFS45H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
