window.products.push({"id":222792,"name":"Wilton Halloween Pre- Baked Pre-Assembled Cookie House Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sCagGPosL._AC_.jpg","description":"Fully assembled Halloween cookie house kit is easy to decorate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sCagGPosL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B000SE1XWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222792","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000SE1XWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000SE1XWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":222793,"name":"Lightsaber Chopsticks Light Up Star Wars Chopsticks Lightsaber Cool Chopsticks Light Saber Led Chopsticks, 1 PAIR, 8 Color Modes Frost Tips Carry Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GgzLqvq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"May the force be with you with every bite! Saber Chops' set of 4 Star Wars lightsaber chopsticks bring so much fun to every meal. Everyone will enjoy these reusable chopsticks, from kids starting to use chopsticks for the first time, all the way to dads secretly dying to perform a lightsaber duel at the dinner table behind Mom's back!   To quote Obi-Wan - the lightsaber is an elegant weapon for a more civilized age. The Saber Chops light saber chopsticks light up every meal. They come in a gift-ready box and are encased in a soft carry pouch for portability. Each of the Starwars chops sticks are made of food-safe ABS plastic, and change color at the click of a button. They run on 3 x LR41 batteries, which are already installed for your convenience.   The Saber Chops lightsaber chopsticks for adults and kids are the very first ones of their type - a true pioneer in reusable chopsticks. We are the trusted and the original ones - we've been here since the beginning, when Anakin was still racing around on Tatooine. We know a thing or two about quality, which is why each set comes with a lifetime warranty just in case something goes wrong.   Use the mini lightsaber replica to tie up a bun - man buns or lady buns alike, the chopsticks hold up hair just fine regardless if you're Rey or Kylo. Pull out a lightsaber chopstick for a quick duel right before dinner. Use the Star Wars sushi sticks as you please - they're sturdy enough to live to fight another day. Just don't get cocky, kid.   Naturally, the chopsticks are fantastic gift items. Give them as birthday gifts for men and women, stocking stuffers, or white elephant gifts. They're bound to put a smile on anyone's face, especially Star Wars aficionados! The included millennium falcon keychain and bottle opener rounds up the set quite beautifully.   As Mando would say, \"This is the way.\" Grab your chopsticks set. Your sushi deserves it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GgzLqvq+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saber Chops","source_asin":"B0BNLXGFL4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-222793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNLXGFL4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNLXGFL4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
